Background music sources
========================

Default: Nightwave Plaza - https://plaza.one
  An independent online radio. VDExtra streams it directly from their server;
  nothing is redistributed with this module. The station and the music it plays
  belong to them and to the respective rights holders. Credited in the in-app
  about dialog. If their terms ever disallow third-party playback, change
  PrefKeys.MUSIC_DEFAULT to MUSIC_BUNDLED and drop the preset from the picker.

Offline fallback: vdextra.ogg - "VDExtra Theme"
  Written for this project and covered by the same MIT licence as the rest of
  VDExtra. It is generated, not recorded: tools/gen-theme.py synthesises the
  loop, so the sound is reproducible from source and carries no third-party
  rights. Used automatically whenever the stream cannot be reached.

Replacing the fallback: drop a new file here under the same name and keep this
file honest about where it came from. Only ship audio the project is allowed to
redistribute - your own work, or a licence that permits it. A bundled track
reaches every user through a public repository and its releases.
